			<unit id="learningGoals">
				<segment>
					<source><pc id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:par" swi18n:slot="children">In this skill you learn to <pc id="c2" type="ui" subType="swi18n:term" swi18n:slot="children">simplify a fraction of fractions</pc>. If you have a fraction of fractions like <ph id="c3" type="ui" subType="swi18n:inline-math"/> then you will be able to <pc id="c4" type="ui" subType="swi18n:skill-link" swi18n:slot="children">turn this into a single fraction</pc> like <ph id="c5" type="ui" subType="swi18n:inline-math"/> and subsequently <pc id="c6" type="ui" subType="swi18n:skill-link" swi18n:slot="children">simplify this fraction</pc> into <ph id="c7" type="ui" subType="swi18n:inline-math"/>. The result is always a fraction that cannot be simplified further.</pc></source>
				</segment>
			</unit>
		</group>
